! EXIT1 fire scenario constrained to the connected free-space component.
! All XB coordinates are aligned to the 0.2 m FDS mesh. The 15 contiguous
! floor VENT records cover 5.16 m2, half of the previous 10.32 m2 footprint.
! The source remains at (9.6,15.9), 1.2 m toward -Y from the first EXIT1 case.

&SURF ID='MACHINERY_OIL_FIRE_OIL', HRRPUA=250.000, RAMP_Q='MACHINERY_OIL_FIRE_RAMP', COLOR='RED' /
